flowchart TB
    subgraph Serving[Source-implemented serving path - runtime verification pending]
        Data[Existing synthetic EHR and wearable telemetry]
        Inputs[Observable-input contract and preprocessing]
        Static[Static patient context]
        Past[Past CGM HR HRV steps sleep and logged meals]
        Twin[UKF S3 physiological state and rollouts]
        Future[Known-time and train-derived habitual features]
        ML[PR-TFT: variable selection LSTM and causal attention]
        Heads[Twin prior plus residual quantiles; hazard and peak heads]
        Cal[Saved interval and hazard calibration]
        Quality[Data quality and serving alert policy]
        API[FastAPI forecast and replay SSE]
        Proxy[Next.js proxy and response validation]
        UI[Patient chart risk panel quality and model contributions]
        Artifacts[Run config split checkpoint normalization and calibration]
        Data --> Inputs
        Inputs --> Static
        Inputs --> Past
        Inputs --> Twin
        Inputs --> Future
        Twin --> Future
        Static --> ML
        Past --> ML
        Future --> ML
        ML --> Heads
        Twin --> Heads
        Heads --> Cal
        Artifacts --> ML
        Artifacts --> Cal
        Cal --> Quality
        Inputs --> Quality
        Quality --> API
        API --> Proxy
        Proxy --> UI
    end
    subgraph Scenario[Prototype scenario API - not human causal validation]
        Plan[Meal activity or skip-habitual-meal request]
        Changed[Alter twin inputs and rerun model]
        ScenarioOut[Scenario quantiles and model-implied changes]
        Disabled[Dashboard Scenario Editor is disabled]
        Plan --> Changed
        Twin --> Changed
        Changed --> ML
        Cal --> ScenarioOut
        ScenarioOut --> API
        Disabled -. future integration .-> Plan
    end
    subgraph Evidence[Separate evidence path]
        Historical[Historical validation manifest - selected and calibrated VAL]
        Tests[Saved engineering test evidence - not scientific performance]
        EW[EW-01 evaluation - governance blocked; no result claimed]
        Ledger[Claim and evidence ledger]
        Historical --> Ledger
        Tests --> Ledger
        EW -. future authorized result only .-> Ledger
    end
    Limits[Research only; synthetic replay; no proven clinical benefit]
    UI --> Limits
    Ledger --> Limits
